<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SGIO — @ViewBag.Title</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Poppins:400,500,600,700,800" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0-alpha1/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="~/css/Layout_Externo.css" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body>

    <div class="auth-wrapper">
        <div class="auth-brand-panel">
            <div class="auth-brand-shape auth-brand-shape-1"></div>
            <div class="auth-brand-shape auth-brand-shape-2"></div>

            <a href="/" class="auth-brand-logo">
                <div class="auth-brand-icon"><i class="bi bi-building"></i></div>
                <div>
                    <strong>SGIO</strong>
                    <small>Gestión de Obras</small>
                </div>
            </a>

            <div class="auth-brand-content">
                <h2>Gestioná tus proyectos de construcción de punta a punta</h2>
                <p>Fases, tareas, hitos, inventario, proveedores y facturación en una sola plataforma.</p>
                <ul class="auth-brand-features">
                    <li><i class="bi bi-kanban"></i> Tablero Kanban y dashboards en tiempo real</li>
                    <li><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i> Control de acceso por rol</li>
                    <li><i class="bi bi-graph-up"></i> Reportes y flujo de caja proyectado</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <a href="/" class="auth-brand-back"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i> Volver al inicio</a>
        </div>

        <div class="auth-form-panel">
            <div class="auth-form-container">
                @RenderBody()
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="~/js/funciones.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
